       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-GESTURAL-KINEMATICS.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-GESTURAL-KINEMATICS-PROOFS.
           05  WS-SWEEPING-FIDELITY-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-KINEMATIC-ENERGY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GESTURE-SEGMENT-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-KINEMATIC-LATENCY-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GESTURAL-KIN-SEAL-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-GESTURAL-KIN-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-KIN-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-KIN-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-SWEEP-AND-ENERGY.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-SEGMENT-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-KIN-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-SWEEP-AND-ENERGY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SWEEPING-FIDELITY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-KINEMATIC-ENERGY-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-SEGMENT-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GESTURE-SEGMENT-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-KINEMATIC-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-KIN-PROOFS.
           IF WS-SWEEPING-FIDELITY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-KINEMATIC-ENERGY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-GESTURE-SEGMENT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-KINEMATIC-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-GESTURAL-KIN-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-KIN-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-KIN-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-KIN-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-KIN-CODE.
